        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_npc",
      "hash64": "65C15D443538643A",
      "text": "Purtroppo oramai ci sei dentro. Abbi pazienza,\\ndagli retta un attimo.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_27",
      "hash64": "29BC1105FA6FF905",
      "text": "Oh, ce l’hai fatta? Ma brav[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_28",
      "hash64": "29BC1205FA6FFAB8",
      "text": "Ed era pure la prima volta che ci provavi!\\nMi sa che ti avevo sottovalutat[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_30",
      "hash64": "29BF9005FA7306A9",
      "text": "Per te che non ti fai sfuggire nulla,\\neccoti qualcosa da acchiappare al volo![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_31",
      "hash64": "29BF8F05FA7304F6",
      "text": "E già che ci siamo, è tempo di vestirsi come\\nsi deve... seguendo il mio look, ovviamente! Toh![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_system_02",
      "hash64": "55A13DED9668E9CE",
      "text": "Hai ricevuto degli [VAR 0xFF00(0008)]abiti del Club Lega[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] da Aris!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_29",
      "hash64": "29BC1305FA6FFC6B",
      "text": "Come ti ho detto, siamo compagni di club in\\nprova! Usa pure il computer quanto ti pare.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_19",
      "hash64": "29C61305FA7850F0",
      "text": "E non è finita qui! Solo per oggi abbiamo\\nun’offerta speciale: unisciti al club e potrai\\r\\npapparti tutti gli snack su cui ti cade l’occhio![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_10",
      "hash64": "CA03212959AD8B7A",
      "text": "Di che snack parli...? Io vedo solo i tuoi avanzi.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_11",
      "hash64": "CA03222959AD8D2D",
      "text": "Se fossi in te, non li toccherei nemmeno.\\nChissà da quanto sono lì.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_20",
      "hash64": "29BC0A05FA6FED20",
      "text": "Dopo tutte queste spiegazioni mi si è aperto\\nlo stomaco.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_21",
      "hash64": "29BC0B05FA6FEED3",
      "text": "Amic[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0606)]i mieihe mie, io faccio un salto in mensa.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0606"
