      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_23",
      "hash64": "29BC0D05FA6FF239",
      "text": "Bella, ci si vede.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_13",
      "hash64": "CA03202959AD89C7",
      "text": "Aaargh, che nervi! Non lo sopporto!\\nCosa gli passa per la testa?![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_14",
      "hash64": "CA031D2959AD84AE",
      "text": "E poi che vuol dire \"è un appuntamento\"? Eh?![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_select_03",
      "hash64": "BB9D8812C0B5CCFE",
      "text": "Cerca di calmarti",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_select_04",
      "hash64": "BB9D8B12C0B5D217",
      "text": "Un appuntamento è...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_15",
      "hash64": "CA031E2959AD8661",
      "text": "Guarda che non è il vostro appuntamento ad\\navermi fatto imbestialire. Non farti strane idee.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_16",
      "hash64": "CA031B2959AD8148",
      "text": "Ma per chi mi hai preso?! So cosa significa!\\nCos’è, giochi a fare l’adult[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_17",
      "hash64": "CA031C2959AD82FB",
      "text": "Scusami... Quando sono qui dentro sono sempre\\nnervosa.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 8,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_18",
      "hash64": "CA03192959AD7DE2",
      "text": "Cambiamo aria, dai.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_19",
      "hash64": "CA031A2959AD7F95",
      "text": "Andiamo in camera tua... Lì non dovrebbe\\ndisturbarci nessuno.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_20",
      "hash64": "C9FF9B2959AA71F1",
      "text": "Non sai dov’è camera tua? Fatti un giro,\\nvedrai che lo capirai da te.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
